      "widgets_values": [
        "QWEN IMAGE EDIT \u2014 Rapid AIO\n\nSETTINGS (v23):  euler_ancestral / beta, 4-8 steps, CFG 1.0, denoise 1.0\nSETTINGS (v19):  er_sde / beta  (swap the checkpoint too)\n\nDENOISE STAYS AT 1.0. This is NOT SDXL img2img -- the input photo enters\nthrough the text-encoder node as conditioning, not through the latent.\n\nINPUT IMAGES are optional. Unplug both LoadImage nodes for pure text-to-image.\nUp to 4 image inputs are available on the patched encoder node.\n\n'Final Image Size' (EmptyLatentImage) controls the OUTPUT size and is also fed\ninto target_latent so the encoder scales your references to match. Match the\naspect ratio of your input photo or you will get unwanted crops.\n\nPROMPTING: give an instruction, not a caption.\n  good -> \"Remove the person on the left. Keep everything else identical.\"\n  bad  -> \"a street with one person\"\nAdding \"Professional digital photography\" reduces the plastic-skin look.\n\nLeave the negative prompt EMPTY -- at CFG 1.0 it does nothing."
      ],
      "title": "READ ME"
    }
